    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An RC car equipped with a live camera, sent deep into an abandoned hospital to investigate disturbing anomalies. But something is lurking in the shadows\u2026 and it's aware of your presence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore dark hallways, eerie rooms, and forgotten corners while avoiding making noise. Your car will beep and flash when near an anomaly\u2014but every sound you make might draw <i>it</i> closer. Document all strange sightings before your signal is lost... forever.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39 A unique horror experience through the lens of an RC camera<br>\ud83d\udd39 Multiple disturbing anomalies to discover<br>\ud83d\udd39 Tense sound-based stealth mechanics<br>\ud83d\udd39 Sudden jumpscares and haunting atmosphere<br>\ud83d\udd39 A mysterious ending that\u2019s worth pushing through</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This is a short, challenging game\u2014make it to the end, if you dare.</strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An RC car equipped with a live camera, sent deep into an abandoned hospital to investigate disturbing anomalies. But something is lurking in the shadows\u2026 and it's aware of your presence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore dark hallways, eerie rooms, and forgotten corners while avoiding making noise. Your car will beep and flash when near an anomaly\u2014but every sound you make might draw <i>it</i> closer. Document all strange sightings before your signal is lost... forever.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39 A unique horror experience through the lens of an RC camera<br>\ud83d\udd39 Multiple disturbing anomalies to discover<br>\ud83d\udd39 Tense sound-based stealth mechanics<br>\ud83d\udd39 Sudden jumpscares and haunting atmosphere<br>\ud83d\udd39 A mysterious ending that\u2019s worth pushing through</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This is a short, challenging game\u2014make it to the end, if you dare.</strong></p>",
